# §4.41 Sums
%%%
number := false
%%%

DLMF §4.41 is a reference page for sums of hyperbolic functions. It contains
no numbered formula displays. For worked sums and related identities, the
source directs the reader to the hyperbolic-function collections of
[Gradshteyn and Ryzhik (2015), Chapter 1](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.41#c15),
[Hansen (1975), §43](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.41#c16),
[Prudnikov et al. (1986a), §5.3](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.41#c17), and
[Zucker (1979)](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.41#c18).

The neighboring DLMF pages are [§4.40 Integrals](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.40)
and [§4.42 Solution of Triangles](https://dlmf.nist.gov/4.42). No additional
mathematical display or Lean declaration is introduced for §4.41 because the
official page supplies no concrete formula record.
